    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Tuesday, February 27, 2018 at 11:55:13 AM UTC-5, Mauricio Garnier-Villarreal wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<div><br></div><div>I found a curious problem with the monteCarloMed function. When a include a subtraction in the expression it doesnt work. If I am giving it a lavaan objects tells out of bounds, but it does work with the addition. And when giving the parameters and ACM it seems to have problems parseing the expression, again it does work with an addition, but it doesnt work with a substraction</div><div><br></div><div>## From lavaan object</div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">mont_dif_pos &lt;- monteCarloMed(&#39;a1*b1 - a2*b3&#39;, object = fit_med2_boot,plot=T)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in lavaan::vcov(object)[paramnames, paramnames] : \r\n  subscript out of bounds</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">monteCarloMed(&#39;a1*b1 + a2*b3&#39;, object = fit_med2_boot,plot=T)\r\n</span>$`Point Estimate`\r\n[1] 0.1232875\r\n\r\n$`95% Confidence Interval`\r\n         \r\nLL 0.0528\r\nUL 0.1961</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">### From ACM</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">med &lt;- &#39;a1*b1 - a1*b2&#39;\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Paramter values and standard errors from analyses\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">aparam &lt;- 1\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">b1param &lt;- 2\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">b2param &lt;- 1\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Asymptotic covariance matrix from analyses\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">AC &lt;- matrix(c(1, .00002, .00003,\r\n</span><span style=\