     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Tuesday, February 27, 2018 at 11:50:32 AM UTC-6, Alex Schoemann wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Mauricio,<div><br></div><div>It looks like a bug in the code. I&#39;ll get it fixed ASAP. For now, things work if you specify the parameters manually and name the parameters the same thing as in the expression (see below for an update of your example)</div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">med &lt;- &#39;a1*b1-a1*b2&#39;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"> ## Paramter values and standard errors from analyses</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"> a1 &lt;- 1</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"> b1 &lt;- 2</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"> b2 &lt;- 1</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"> ## Asymptotic covariance matrix from analyses</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"> AC &lt;- matrix(c(1, .00002, .00003,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">                                  .00002, 1, .00002,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">                                  .00003, .00002, 1), nrow = 3, byrow = TRUE)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">  ## Compute CI do not include a plot</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">  monteCarloMed(med, c(a1, b1, b2), ACM = AC)</font></div><br>On Tuesday, February 27, 2018 at 11:55:13 AM UTC-5, Mauricio Garnier-Villarreal wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<div><br></div><div>I found a curious problem with the monteCarloMed function. When a include a subtraction in the expression it doesnt work. If I am giving it a lavaan objects tells out of bounds, but it does work with the addition. And when giving the parameters and ACM it seems to have problems parseing the expression, again it does work with an addition, but it doesnt work with a substraction</div><div><br></div><div>## From lavaan object</div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">mont_dif_pos &lt;- monteCarloMed(&#39;a1*b1 - a2*b3&#39;, object = fit_med2_boot,plot=T)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in lavaan::vcov(object)[paramnames, paramnames] : \r\n  subscript out of bounds</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">monteCarloMed(&#39;a1*b1 + a2*b3&#39;, object = fit_med2_boot,plot=T)\r\n</span>$`Point Estimate`\r\n[1] 0.1232875\r\n\r\n$`95% Confidence Interval`\r\n         \r\nLL 0.0528\r\nUL 0.1961</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">### From ACM</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">med &lt;- &#39;a1*b1 - a1*b2&#39;\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Paramter values and standard errors from analyses\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">aparam &lt;- 1\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">b1param &lt;- 2\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">b2param &lt;- 1\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Asymptotic covariance matrix from analyses\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">AC &lt;- matrix(c(1, .00002, .00003,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">               .00002, 1, .00002,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">               .00003, .00002, 1), nrow = 3, byrow = TRUE)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Compute CI do not include a plot\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">monteCarloMed(med, coef1 = aparam, coef2 = b1param,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">              coef3 = b2param, ACM = AC)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in eval(parse(text = expression)) : object &#39;b1&#39; not found</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">med &lt;- &#39;a1*b1 + a1*b2&#39;\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Paramter values and standard errors from analyses\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">aparam &lt;- 1\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">b1param &lt;- 2\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">b2param &lt;- 1\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Asymptotic covariance matrix from analyses\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">AC &lt;- matrix(c(1, .00002, .00003,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">               .00002, 1, .00002,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">               .00003, .00002, 1), nrow = 3, byrow = TRUE)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">## Compute CI do not include a plot\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">monteCarloMed(med, coef1 = aparam, coef2 = b1param,\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">              coef3 = b2param, ACM = AC)\r\n</span>$`Point Estimate`\r\n[1] 3\r\n\r\n$`95% Confidence Interval`\r\n          \r\nLL -2.9355\r\nUL 11.3265</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Am I missing something or is this a bug in the function?</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Thanks</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Courier;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:10.6667px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre></span></pre></pre></span></pre></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
